{"watch":17,"start":4800,"events":[{"seq":864,"t":4800,"type":"watch","watch":17},{"seq":865,"t":4800,"type":"decode","house":"rhino","letter":"L170","text":"HORSE, S_O_T NORTH BANK _EST.","readable":true},{"seq":866,"t":4800,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1760,"retries":0},{"seq":867,"t":4800,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It's Watch 17. Doctrine says take the west ford early and hold it. Rhino forces are already at F1 (West Ford). I must act on the captured kite letter: 'MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE'. I will use my cavalry to intercept them there, and use infantry to reinforce F1 or F2."},{"seq":868,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c276","house":"rhino","letter":"L329","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":4800,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":869,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c277","house":"rhino","letter":"L330","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":4800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":870,"t":4800,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1755,"retries":0},{"seq":871,"t":4800,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino and Tiger have forces near F1/n-west. Orchid has cavalry near n-west. My forces are strong but spread. Doctrine suggests decoys and two riders. I need to probe the enemy positions around F1 and F3."},{"seq":872,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c278","house":"kite","letter":"L331","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":5100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, ITQLD SK NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":873,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c279","house":"kite","letter":"L332","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":5100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, ITQLD SK IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":874,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c280","house":"kite","letter":"L333","k